VERSION 120

EDIT UG_GATEWAY_MAIN_MENUBAR

MENU NX_REFINE_MENU

BUTTON NX_REFINE_REMOVE_BLENDS
LABEL Remove Blends
MESSAGE Select solid bodies, filter blends by minimum and maximum radius, review faces, and remove what can be healed.
BITMAP nxrefine_remove_blends.bmp
ACTIONS NXRefine.RemoveBlends.dll

BUTTON NX_REFINE_FILL_HOLES
LABEL Fill Holes
MESSAGE Select bodies to detect inner holes, set a maximum radius, and review the expanded hole faces.
BITMAP nxrefine_fill_holes.bmp
ACTIONS NXRefine.FillHoles.dll

BUTTON NX_REFINE_CLEAR_CAVITIES
LABEL Clear Cavities
MESSAGE Select solid bodies to find fully enclosed internal cavities, review the highlighted cavity faces, and apply cleanup.
BITMAP nxrefine_clear_cavities.bmp
ACTIONS NXRefine.ClearCavities.dll

BUTTON NX_REFINE_REPAIR_UNATTACHED
LABEL Repair Unattached Faces
MESSAGE Select solid bodies to find small gaps between faces, review the highlighted pairs, and repair selected gaps.
BITMAP nxrefine_repair_unattached.bmp
ACTIONS NXRefine.RepairUnattached.dll

BUTTON NX_REFINE_REMOVE_MARKINGS
LABEL Remove Markings
MESSAGE Select multiple carrier faces and review their connected marking candidates.
BITMAP nxrefine_remove_markings.bmp
ACTIONS NXRefine.RemoveMarkings.dll

BUTTON NX_REFINE_REPAIR_SHEETS
LABEL Repair Sheets
MESSAGE Sew sheet bodies using the configured tolerance.
BITMAP nxrefine_repair_sheets.bmp
ACTIONS NXRefine.RepairSheets.dll

BUTTON NX_REFINE_PATCH_OPENINGS
LABEL Patch Openings
MESSAGE Detect and highlight open sheet boundaries.
BITMAP nxrefine_patch_openings.bmp
ACTIONS NXRefine.PatchOpenings.dll

BUTTON NX_REFINE_SETTINGS
LABEL Settings
MESSAGE Configure cleanup thresholds and tolerances.
BITMAP nxrefine_settings.bmp
ACTIONS NXRefine.Settings.dll

BUTTON NX_REFINE_ABOUT
LABEL About
MESSAGE Show NX Refine version and safety information.
BITMAP nxrefine_about.bmp
ACTIONS NXRefine.About.dll

END_OF_MENU

BEFORE UG_HELP
    CASCADE_BUTTON NX_REFINE_MENU
    LABEL NX Refine
END_OF_BEFORE
